# Secrets. Signing keys are generated by scripts/make_records.py and never
# belong in the repo. The demo's whole trust claim is that a fresh clone can
# verify every signature from the public JWKs alone; a committed private key
# would let anyone mint records that verify.
*.pem
data/keys/*.private.pem

# Runtime model transcript: real prompts and completions, appended every run.
data/transcript.jsonl
